   "en": "The ⟦0⟧ is a ⟦1⟧ ⟦2⟧ in Southeast Asia with a population of ⟦3⟧ (core) and another ⟦4⟧ (non-core). It borders ⟦5⟧ to the east, ⟦6⟧ Timor to the southeast, and ⟦7⟧ to the north.",
